title: 'statement-store: forward statements to every connected topic replica'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    On the experimental v2 DHT statement path, forwarding capped the whole
    closest-first target list at `gossip_target`, so the number of persisted
    copies of a statement saturated at `gossip_target + 1` instead of the
    configured replication factor. Forwarding now always targets every
    connected replica of a statement's topic and applies the `gossip_target`
    cap only to the routing leg (peers closer to the topic than the local
    node). Only affects nodes running with `STATEMENT_STORE_V2_DHT_ENABLED=1`.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
